    title: "US must leave West Asia and return to its own region, Iranian lawmaker says",
    summary: "US must leave West Asia and return to its own region, Iranian lawmaker says An Iranian lawmaker said the United States must withdraw from West Asia and return to its own geographic sphere. Major-General Mohammad Esmaeil Kowsari, a member of parliament’s National Security and Foreign Policy Committee, told Iran’s Mehr news agency that the US could no longer confront Iran. He said Washington had issued shifting threats, at times discussing military action on the ground and at others threatening to open the Strait of Hormuz. Kowsari also pointed to US threats against Iran’s nuclear programme and proposals for an economic, land, air and naval blockade of the country. He said that Washington should leave West Asia and return to its own geographical sphere, which he said was 12,000km away.",
